<title>UK: B.A.T names O'Sullivan CEO of Eagle Star.</title>
<headline>B.A.T names O'Sullivan CEO of Eagle Star.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>British finance and tobacco group B.A.T Industries Plc said on Wednesday it had named Patrick O'Sullivan as the new chief executive of its Eagle Star insurance group.</p>
<p>B.A.T said O'Sullivan was currently chief operating officer at BZW, the investment banking arm of British bank Barclays Plc.</p>
